  "title": "Chef John&#39;s BLT Pasta",
  "description": "The flavors of America&#39;s favorite sandwich, bacon, lettuce, and tomato, combine in a fresh and tasty BLT pasta dish that cooks up in a jiffy.",
  "authors": [
